### Test Driver Approval Flow

# 1. Get list of pending drivers
GET http://localhost:3000/api/admin/drivers/pending
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ADMIN_TOKEN_HERE

###

# 2. Approve a specific driver (replace DRIVER_ID with actual ID)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/admin/drivers/DRIVER_ID/approve
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ADMIN_TOKEN_HERE

###

# 3. Check driver profile after approval
GET http://localhost:3000/api/drivers/me
Authorization: Bearer DRIVER_TOKEN_HERE

###

# Alternative: Direct database update (for testing only)
# Run this SQL in your database client:
# UPDATE drivers SET status = 'VERIFIED', approved_at = NOW() WHERE id = 'YOUR_DRIVER_ID';
# Then manually call the initialization:
# You'll need to create a test endpoint for this
